@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam classBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #17405A
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
title Analysis — source authority and feedback
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Accepted authority\nScope + bounded owner decisions" as A #17405A
rectangle "Working specification\nRequirements + scenarios + dictionary\nDetailed proposals retain their status" as W
rectangle "Known constraints\nScope and dependencies; existing host\nOAuth absent; backups not configured" as F #4A302B
rectangle "Analysis models\nStructure + transformations + behavior" as M #17405A
rectangle "Consistency review\nSources, outcomes, assumptions and gates" as R
rectangle "Qualified design-handoff candidate\nReviewed conclusions + unresolved gates" as H #17405A
A -[hidden]right- W
W -[hidden]right- F
A --> M : governs
W --> M : describes intended behavior
F --> M : constrains
M --> R : reviewed model package
R --> H : justified conclusions
R -[dashed,norank]-> W : refine a missing/conflicting rule\nwithout inventing acceptance
legend bottom
Arrows describe document influence and review feedback.
They are not application data flows or automatic approvals.
endlegend
@enduml
